{"created": "2026-08-29T02:38:32.928491+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-29T02:38:33.293951+00:00", "id": 22152061, "conceptrecid": "22152060", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22152061", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22152060", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22152061", "metadata": {"title": "Lactic acid production from apple, pear and grape pomace hydrolysates by six lactic acid bacterial species: fermentation dataset and fitted models", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22152061", "publication_date": "2026-08-29", "description": "<p>Fermentation dataset, derived variables and fitted models supporting the article<br>\"Lactic acid production from apple, pear and grape pomace hydrolysates by six lactic<br>acid bacterial species: medium simplification and kinetic modelling\".</p>\n<p>Full factorial design, n = 504: six lactic acid bacterial species (Lactiplantibacillus<br>plantarum ATCC 8014, Limosilactobacillus reuteri DSM 20016, Lacticaseibacillus<br>paracasei DSM 20008, Lcb. casei ATCC 393, Levilactobacillus brevis DSM 20054 and<br>Lcb. rhamnosus ATCC 53103) x four carbon sources (glucose, apple, pear and grape<br>pomace hydrolysates) x seven MRS formulations x three independent biological<br>replicates. All media were standardised to 50 g/L initial reducing sugars;<br>fermentations ran for 72 h at 37 degrees Celsius at an initial pH of 6.3.</p>\n<p>The deposit contains the 504 individual fermentation records with optical density,<br>pH, residual reducing sugars and lactic acid concentration, together with derived<br>variables, every table reported in the article, and the scripts that reproduce the<br>cleaning, the statistical model, the kinetic fits and the figures. Corrections<br>applied to the raw laboratory records are documented in full in the README.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Mamani, Maribel", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0007-1868-9853"}, {"name": "Valentina, Guzm\u00e1n", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Castillo, Benjam\u00edn", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Rogel, Cristian", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Quispe, Cristina", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Vald\u00e9s Vergara, Cristian Rodrigo", "affiliation": "Catholic University of the Maule", "orcid": "0000-0002-0249-9445"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22152060"}}]}}, "title": "Lactic acid production from apple, pear and grape pomace hydrolysates by six lactic acid bacterial species: fermentation dataset and fitted models", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22152061", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22152061?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22152061", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22152061", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22152061", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152060", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22152060", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22152060", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22152060", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22152061/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22152061/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22152061/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22152061/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/